# Local scratch / legacy artifacts — never meant to ship or be tracked.
# See _context/BUG-POSTMORTEM.md P572 session (v51.84) for why this file exists:
# repo had zero .gitignore, so these accumulated as permanent `git status` noise.

# Pre-edit backup hoard from a deprecated v30-era rule (working-rules.md §1/§6a,
# itself gitignored below) that mandated copying the whole file before every edit.
# Superseded by git history; these .bak snapshots are redundant with old commits.
_backup/

# Same 2026-04-17 .bak snapshots as above, relocated out of _backup/ during the
# 2026-07-04 config audit for tidiness. Still redundant with git history.
_archive/_backup-2026-04-17-legacy/

# Build/dev output scratch.
outputs/
tmp/
.cache/

# Local viewport screenshots are regenerated by the browser matrix and are not
# release inputs. Machine-readable audit summaries under _artifacts stay tracked.
_artifacts/viewport-matrix/*.png

# `.agents/skills` is the portable Codex discovery surface and is intentionally
# tracked. Machine-local agent state must be ignored with a narrower rule if added.

# Legacy Codex-only governance docs that duplicate/contradict the current
# git-tracked _context/RULES.md + QA-CHECKLIST.md (e.g. mandatory-backup-before-edit,
# "never delete files" — both superseded). Kept locally for history, not tracked.
_context/working-rules.md
_context/voice-and-style.md
_context/archive-reports/

# Autoresearch outputs are ephemeral working state, not committed artifacts.
autoresearch-*/

